{"event":"step_update","step_update":{"conversation_id":"75f68d3a-81d0-4d52-abdc-1aeed05b23c2","step_index":50,"state":"DONE","step_type":"tool","tool_name":"run_command","duration_seconds":0.160549,"tool_info":{"name":"run_command","parameters":{"CommandLine":"cat 01-CS-Foundations/Operating-Systems/AOS/Part-5-Internet-Scale-Real-Time-and-Security/README.md"},"output":"---\r\ntype: moc\r\ntrack: [sde, distinguished]\r\nlevel:\r\nstatus: draft\r\nlast_reviewed:\r\nsources: []\r\ncourse: cs6210\r\ntags: [cs6210]\r\n---\r\n\r\n# Part 5 - Internet Scale, Real Time, and Security\r\n\r\nLessons 9-11: giant-scale services, MapReduce, CDNs and DHTs, time-sensitive Linux, persistent temporal streams, and security principles and the Andrew system.\r\n\r\n| Note | Concepts | Lab |\r\n| --- | ---: | --- |\r\n| [L09a Giant Scale Services](L09a-Giant-Scale-Services.md) | 10 | [lab-19-giant-scale](../labs/lab-19-giant-scale/README.md) |\r\n| [L09b MapReduce](L09b-MapReduce.md) | 9 | [lab-20-mapreduce](../labs/lab-20-mapreduce/README.md) |\r\n| [L09c Content Delivery Networks](L09c-Content-Delivery-Networks.md) | 10 | [lab-21-dht](../labs/lab-21-dht/README.md) |\r\n| [L10a TS-Linux](L10a-TS-Linux.md) | 9 | [lab-22-realtime](../labs/lab-22-realtime/README.md) |\r\n| [L10b Persistent Temporal Streams](L10b-Persistent-Temporal-Streams.md) | 7 | [lab-23-temporal-streams](../labs/lab-23-temporal-streams/README.md) |\r\n| [L11a Principles of Information Security](L11a-Principles-of-Information-Security.md) | 13 | [lab-24-security](../labs/lab-24-security/README.md) |\r\n| [L11b Security in the Andrew System](L11b-Security-in-the-Andrew-System.md) | 11 | [lab-24-security](../labs/lab-24-security/README.md) |\r\n\r\n## Papers\r\n\r\n- [MapReduce: Simplified Data Processing on Large Clusters](../Papers/L09-MapReduce.md) - OSDI 2004, required\r\n- [Lessons from Giant-Scale Services](../Papers/L09-Giant-Scale-Services.md) - IEEE Internet Computing 2001, partial\r\n- [Web Search for a Planet: The Google Cluster Architecture](../Papers/L09-Web-Search-for-a-Planet.md) - IEEE Micro 2003, partial\r\n- [Democratizing Content Publication with Coral](../Papers/L09-Coral.md) - NSDI 2004, required\r\n- [Dynamo: Amazon's Highly Available Key-value Store](../Papers/L09-Dynamo.md) - SOSP 2007, required\r\n- [Unraveling the Web Services Web: An Introduction to SOAP, WSDL, and UDDI](../Papers/L09-Web-Services-SOAP-WSDL-UDDI.md) - IEEE Internet Computing 2002, self-study\r\n- [The Next Step in Web Services](../Papers/L09-Next-Step-in-Web-Services.md) - CACM 2003, self-study\r\n- [Supporting Time-Sensitive Applications on a Commodity OS](../Papers/L10-Time-Sensitive-Commodity-OS.md) - OSDI 2002, required\r\n- [Virtualize Everything but Time](../Papers/L10-Virtualize-Everything-but-Time.md) - OSDI 2010, required\r\n- [Persistent Temporal Streams](../Papers/L10-Persistent-Temporal-Streams.md) - Middleware 2009, required\r\n- [Yima: A Second-Generation Continuous Media Server](../Papers/L10-Yima.md) - IEEE Computer 2002, required\r\n- [The Protection of Information in Computer Systems](../Papers/L11-Protection-Control-of-Information.md) - Proceedings of the IEEE 1975, required\r\n- [Integrating Security in a Large Distributed System](../Papers/L11-Andrew-Security.md) - TOCS 1989, required\r\n\r\n## Practice\r\n\r\n- [Practice L09](../Practice/Practice-L09.md)\r\n- [Practice L10](../Practice/Practice-L10.md)\r\n- [Practice L11](../Practice/Practice-L11.md)\r\n"}}}
